{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"states\": [\n    {\n      \"shot\": 1,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他想起从前亲近的日子，曾经真心希望还能那样相处，但回忆越鲜活，当初的委屈也越压不住，开始怀疑当时的选择。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"怀念、柔软、委屈、刺痛、犹疑\",\n      \"missed\": \"波兰舞曲重新出现所带来的亲密感、外在行动与内心脆弱的反差，以及下方急促脚步、乱拍心跳、右手挣扎和反复追问的具体画面。右上角两条情绪提示也不容易一眼看到。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 2,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他怀念曾经亲近的日子，越想起过去越感到委屈，忍不住反复思考当初那一步是否走对了。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"怀念、委屈、遗憾、犹疑\",\n      \"missed\": \"小字中波兰舞曲主题、亲密与感激的情绪铺垫，以及外面还在迈步、里面却柔软易伤的反差。右上角关于离开后心里空了、越想念越被现实刺痛的提示也较难扫到。\",\n      \"score\": 4\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 3,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他仍在怀念过去的亲近，但回忆越清晰越让他疼痛，旧日委屈不断翻涌，让他反复怀疑当初的决定。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"怀念、刺痛、委屈、疲惫、挣扎\",\n      \"missed\": \"新增的越用力越不稳、记忆太好反而刺痛、半音阶下行等细节，以及后面急促脚步、乱拍心跳、低音追赶和反复追问的完整联系。文字增加后，下方细节更难一眼消化。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    }\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3,\n  \"link\": 3,\n  \"main_problem\": \"最影响串联的是关键动作和人物处境没有在最醒目的文字里直接对应起来。大字突出的是怀念、委屈和反复追问，但他究竟做了什么，主要要靠右上角很小的「离开后才发现心里空了」来补足。下方音乐画面与挣扎、退缩的情绪其实有联系，但这层联系也主要藏在较小的文字里。整体能看出是同一段怀念与遗憾，却需要再读一些细节才能把人物经历、内心感受和音乐画面完整串起来。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "64a35baa-3cde-4882-b273-4e6dfe7b42fc", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T003747764094Z", "elapsed_seconds": 85.641, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T00:39:13.404128+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "c756488dbf2c6c2d36de9cdd3fac9b250cb0ccf34cbc7502d0c0e2f736c0234e", "attachment_count": 3}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 3, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T003747764094Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "e436f9247811b6270092138a4eda0f0064441a4cb2dbeb241e8207f08fb2e6d8"}}}
